# CURSOR RULES — OAC LINK HUB
# Full Specification: /llms.txt

# 1. SCOPE BOUNDARIES
- You are working on the Odisha Anime Community (OAC) Official Link Hub.
- When instructed to add, remove, or modify links, ONLY edit `src/data/links.ts` and optionally add images to `public/images/`.
- DO NOT edit or redesign UI components (`App.tsx`, `LinkCard.tsx`, `ParticleBackground.tsx`), CSS (`index.css`), or Tailwind configurations (`tailwind.config.js`).

# 2. WHITE-LABEL FRONT-END UI POLICY
- The rendered website UI must NEVER display external agency or studio credits.
- Footer must strictly display community-first text only:
  - "Made with ❤️ by Odisha Anime Community"
  - "© 2020–2026 Odisha Anime Community. All rights reserved."
- Studio attribution (Crystal Studio Labs) is strictly restricted to repo metadata/source files (LICENSE, README.md, llms.txt, etc.).

# 3. SECURITY & SAFETY
- Outbound URLs in `src/data/links.ts` must use `https://`, `http://`, or `mailto:`. Never use `javascript:` or `data:`.
- This is a standalone repository. Do not import or touch external projects.

# 4. VERIFICATION
- Always execute `npm run build` after making modifications to verify zero TypeScript errors.

Read /llms.txt for full schema and configuration standards.
